|lore=ISB attaché to the ''Executor''. Detention Officer. Political Liaison for COMPNOR. Responsible for all prisoner transfers. Fiercely loyal to the Emperor’s New Order.
|game_text=Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. Opponent’s smugglers are forfeit -2. During any control phase, may take one Spice Mines Of Kessel into hand from Reserve Deck; reshuffle. Once per game, may take an Immediate Effect and/or a prison into hand from Reserve Deck; reshuffle.
|errata_history=The following published text states belong to [[Virtual Set 5: A Dark Time]]. Dates of archived copies and repository uploads attest those copies; they do not by themselves establish first release.
* '''Original''': [[Corporal Vandolay (V) (Virtual Set 5: A Dark Time)]] — Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. Once per control phase, may ▲ Spice Mines Of Kessel. Opponent's smugglers are forfeit -2. Once per game, may ▲ one Immediate Effect and/or any prison.
* '''Errata (2006)''': [[Corporal Vandolay (V) (Virtual Set 5: A Dark Time) (Errata)]] — Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. Opponent’s smugglers are forfeit -2. During any control phase, may take one Spice Mines Of Kessel into hand from Reserve Deck; reshuffle. Once per game, may take an Immediate Effect and/or a prison into hand from Reserve Deck; reshuffle.
